  "title": "Easy Baklava",
  "description": "A simple and easy baklava recipe. Phyllo dough is layered with a cinnamon-nut filling, then topped with a honey syrup. Serve slices in cupcake papers.",
  "authors": [
    "Arvilla"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-07-16T22:15:41-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-06-24T12:26:45-04:00",
